\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. From all that dwell below the skies
\par Let the creator's praise arise:
\par Hallelijah !
\par Let the redeemer's praise be sung,
\par Through every land, by every tongue:
\par Hallelujah !
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Eternal are Thy mercies, Lord;
\par Eternal truth attends Thy word:
\par Hallelujah !
\par Thy praise shall sound from shore to shore,
\par Till suns shall rise and set no more:
\par Hallelujah !
\par \cf1\ul\b\f1\fs16 
\par 
\par }

